# 2. USER ROLES

Implement three separate roles.

## Role 1: Company User

Purpose:

Creates and manages procurement requests.

Permissions:

- View dashboard
- Create procurement request
- View own procurement requests
- Upload supplier quotations
- View AI analysis
- View suppliers
- View inventory
- View recommendations
- Submit procurement for approval
- View procurement history
- View notifications
- Manage own profile

Cannot:

- Execute final payment
