---

## Role 2: Finance Approver

Purpose:

Reviews AI recommendations and authorizes payments.

Permissions:

- View finance dashboard
- View all procurement requests
- Review AI recommendations
- Review supplier comparisons
- Review risk analysis
- Approve procurement
- Reject procurement
- Request changes
