# 57. PAYPAL SANDBOX

Use PayPal Sandbox only for development/demo.

The payment flow must be:

```text
Procurement Request
        ↓
AI Recommendation
        ↓
Finance Approval
        ↓
Create PayPal Order
        ↓
PayPal Sandbox Approval
        ↓
Capture Payment
        ↓
Payment Confirmation
        ↓
Update Procurement
        ↓
Audit Log
```

The application must display the PayPal order ID and transaction status after payment.

