2. Enter a procurement request.
3. See AI understand the request.
4. See existing inventory.
5. Upload supplier quotations.
6. Watch AI extract quotation information.
7. Compare suppliers.
8. See true cost.
9. See supplier risk.
10. Receive a clear AI recommendation.
11. Log into Finance.
12. Review the recommendation.
13. Approve the purchase.
14. Pay through PayPal Sandbox.
15. See the completed transaction.
16. Open the audit trail and see the entire procurement lifecycle.

The central experience must clearly demonstrate:

**ProcurePilot AI makes procurement decisions intelligently, but humans retain financial control. PayPal provides the secure execution layer for the approved transaction.**

